# Patch queue for the vendored pstack source.
#
# Format follows Debian's 3.0 (quilt) `patches/series`. One line per patch,
# in apply order. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored. `tools/build-harness.mjs`
# reads this file and refuses to build when a named patch is missing.
#
# Every patch file carries a DEP-3 header (https://wiki.debian.org/Specification/dep3).
# The fields that matter for this queue are `Forwarded` and `Bug`, because a patch
# is a loan against upstream, not a feature of this package.
#
#   Forwarded: <pull-request-url>   awaiting upstream, drop the patch when it merges
#   Forwarded: not-needed           no upstream to send it to
#
# A patch with no Forwarded line is a debt this queue has not admitted yet.
#
# Ordering rule. Independent patches first. When two patches touch the same
# hunk, the earlier one is the prerequisite and the later one rebases onto it.
#
# <patch-name>.patch
